flowchart TD
  B["One definition bound to<br/>one rendered instance"] -->|"accepted event"| I["Invocation: prerequisites and handler<br/>one work deadline"]
  I -->|"may send"| S["Server request<br/>independent deadline and authority"]
  I -->|"handler returned"| H["Required success hook<br/>own hook budget"]
  I -->|"failure or cancellation"| Q["Outcome decided once;<br/>outcome hook, token releases, final hook<br/>each step has its own budget"]
  H --> Q
  H -.->|"inside an eligible hook"| C{"After an await in this callback:<br/>current() still true?"}
  Q -.->|"inside an eligible presenting hook"| C
  C -->|"yes"| W["Synchronous presentation write<br/>before this callback ends"]
  C -->|"no"| X["Skip stale presentation<br/>retain the known outcome"]
  I -->|"acquires"| R["Resource token in invocation scope"]
  R -->|"explicit transfer"| O["Application resource owner<br/>player may outlive the invocation"]
  R -->|"not transferred: release in cleanup"| Q
  T["Selection change or binding disposal"] -->|"retire undecided work"| I
  V["View teardown: stop delivery<br/>and abort the view signal"] --> T
  V -->|"application cleanup"| O
  V --> K["Answer host teardown first;<br/>then close connection once"]
